   strategic downscaling technique, applying the Stochastic Bayesian
   Downscaling (SBD) algorithm to convert monthly DENV case data to daily
   frequency. This approach addresses key issues in the handling of sparse
   datasets and missing data, offering novel insights into the potential
   accuracy benefits of data downscaling in time series forecasting. Among
   the models assessed, the decision tree demonstrated superior performance
   on the actual monthly data, achieving an accuracy of
