Abstract = {In Cambodia, dengue outbreaks occur each rainy season (May-October) but
   vary in magnitude. Using national surveillance data, we designed a tool
   that can predict 90\% of the variance in peak magnitude by April, when
   typically <10\% of dengue cases have been reported. This prediction may
   help hospitals anticipate excess patients.},
